{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25457","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 潭上紫藤 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 潭上紫藤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故乡春欲尽，一岁芳难再。\n岩树已青葱，吾庐日堪爱。\n幽溪人未去，芳草行应碍。\n遥忆紫藤垂，繁英照潭黛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}